    <sys:String x:Key="S.Settings.IdleTitle">Screen-off and sleep times</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.Settings.IdleDesc">Each mode is its own power plan: these are the same values as in Control Panel, and a change in either shows in both. Nextcalibur never changes them by itself.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.Idle.Mode">Mode</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.Idle.DisplayAc">Display off (plugged in)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.Idle.DisplayDc">Display off (on battery)</sys:String>
