    <sys:String x:Key="S.Tour.Step.SettingFnShortcuts.Body">For an external keyboard: the laptop keyboard's Fn+1, Fn+Space and the mode key, as shortcuts. Off until you switch them on; each can be switched on alone, or all at once, and given other keys. A shortcut another program, Windows or your keyboard layout already uses is refused and the reason shown.</sys:String>
